{"id":"n69228-1-9","stage":5,"title":"용량 · 容量","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69228-1-9-1","ko":"상자에 이 서류를 모두 담을 수 있을까요?","zh":"这些文件都能放进那个箱子里吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"상자에","meaning":"箱子","explanation":"상자：箱子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"상자","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62801","senseId":"1","lemma":"상자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서류를","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모두","meaning":"都，全","explanation":"모두：都，全","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28135","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"담을","meaning":"装，盛","explanation":"담다：装，盛；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"담다","audio":"/audio/41232b29db6bd744f882.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73283","senseId":"1","lemma":"담다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을까요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e6bb1dea433d8fa4","term":"상자","zh":"箱子","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3","entryId":"62801","definition":"存放东西的木制或纸制四方形筒。","pronunciation":["상자"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e90c4f2356666af1","term":"서류","zh":"文件，材料","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3","entryId":"62870","definition":"用文字记录的文书。","pronunciation":["서류"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"都，全","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"28135","definition":"一个不漏，全都。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"41232b29db6bd744","term":"담다","zh":"装，盛","audio":"/audio/41232b29db6bd744f882.mp3","entryId":"73283","definition":"把某物装进器皿里等。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/46dd4d2d24c0b8259924.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69228-1-9-2","ko":"글쎄요, 용량이 부족할 것 같습니다.","zh":"不好说，容量好像不够用。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄요,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60633","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"용량이","meaning":"容量，储存量","explanation":"용량：容量，储存量；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"용량","audio":"/audio/e6ac1362406cc066d352.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69228","senseId":"1","lemma":"용량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부족할","meaning":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","explanation":"부족하다：不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"부족하다","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59849","senseId":"1","lemma":"부족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b6013caa74979f40","term":"글쎄요","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3","entryId":"60633","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄요"]},{"id":"e6ac1362406cc066","term":"용량","zh":"容量，储存量","audio":"/audio/e6ac1362406cc066d352.mp3","entryId":"69228","definition":"一定空间内可以装的量。","pronunciation":["용냥"]},{"id":"3dd9c5f65c6da41a","term":"부족하다","zh":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3","entryId":"59849","definition":"未能达到需要的数量或基准，不充裕。","pronunciation":["부조카다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b133cbdc8569d2cd99d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.29,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69228","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不好说，容量好像不够用。","老师，时间已经不多了。","这些文件都能放进那个箱子里吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不好说，容量好像不够用。","这些文件都能放进那个箱子里吗？","老师，时间已经不多了。"],"answer":0}]}
